---
description: Server and client import boundaries
alwaysApply: true
---

- Database modules, repositories, server services, `src/lib/env/server.ts`, `src/lib/auth/auth.ts`, and `src/lib/logger/logger.ts` must import `server-only`.
- Client components may import `src/lib/auth/auth-client.ts`, feature schemas, and `src/lib/api/client.ts`.
- Do not pass secrets or session tokens to client components.
- Do not read `NEXT_PUBLIC_` variables for secrets. Add a public variable only when the browser must see it.
- `src/proxy.ts` may only check for a session cookie and redirect. It is not authorization.
